{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"discount-calculator UI copy.method.paragraphs.5","detected_language":"nl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"discount-calculator.copy.method.paragraphs.5","keys":["discount-calculator.copy.method.paragraphs.5"],"locale":"nl","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Bedragen worden afgerond op twee cijfers achter de komma, met halve centen uit de buurt van nul. De exacte eindwaarde wordt ook weergegeven. Belastingen, verzendkosten, minimumuitgavenregels en winkelspecifieke kortingsbonbeperkingen worden niet afgeleid.","record_id":"5b5977cd38f4f8174f23451e57d2ffa7ca3e630f1387941469a4784739cc583e","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":1.3017712883749937,"source":"Calculations remain exact fractions until display. Amounts round to two decimal places, with half-cent ties away from zero. Exact final values are also shown. Tax, shipping, minimum-spend rules and store-specific coupon restrictions are not inferred.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"23d3f820fe224c0931a2e4649ac10e8b2399f6f530315d67eb55ed0915ee2ca6","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Bedragen worden afgerond op twee cijfers achter de komma, met halve centen uit de buurt van nul. De exacte eindwaarde wordt ook weergegeven. Belastingen, verzendkosten, minimumuitgavenregels en winkelspecifieke kortingsbonbeperkingen worden niet afgeleid.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
